@HotelBooking_HostAddress = https://localhost:7083

### Health Check
GET {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/database/health
Accept: application/json


### Available Rooms
GET {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/available?checkIn=2026-12-20&checkOut=2026-12-22&guests=2
Accept: application/json


### Create Booking
POST {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2026-12-20",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-12-22",
  "guestCount": 2
}


### Confirm Booking
PUT {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/22281/confirm
Accept: application/json


### Check-in Booking
PUT {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/22281/check-in
Accept: application/json


### Check-out Booking
PUT {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/22281/check-out
Accept: application/json

### Add Service
POST {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/13/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}


### Calculate Booking Total
GET {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/13/total
Accept: application/json


### Booking History
GET {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/history?phone=0901000001&from=2026-01-01&to=2027-01-01
Accept: application/json


### Create Booking For Cancel Test
POST {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### Cancel Booking
PUT {{HotelBooking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/22283/cancel
Accept: application/json